      "content": "got it. so it's basically one phenomenon viewed from two angles. i guess i'm just trying to figure out if there are any specific parts of the wing or the air movement that are most \"active\" in making that happen. like is there more of a struggle happening at the leading edge or the trailing edge to make all that pressure and deflection work?",
